Phase 1c-ii (collision detection and contacts) ports these files and functions
(src/engine/ of the same tree):

  engine_collision_driver.c
                         the rigid control flow of mj_collision, as a static
                         candidate list (src/candidates.rs) and a two-pass step
                         (src/collision.rs): filterCollisionPair, filterBodyPair,
                         filterBitmask, mj_filterSphere with planeGeomDist,
                         getMargin, getGap, pushGeomGeom (the orientation of a
                         pair), contactcompare (as the static order), mj_maxContact,
                         mj_contactParam, mj_setContact, addPairContacts, and the
                         collision table mjCOLLISIONFUNC. The sweep-and-prune, the
                         BVH midphase, the convex path (GJK and EPA), explicit
                         pairs, flex and sleep are not ported (the module headers
                         say why each is unreachable or deferred)
  engine_collision_primitive.c   (Copyright 2021 DeepMind Technologies Limited)
                         mjraw_PlaneSphere, mjc_PlaneSphere, mjc_PlaneCapsule,
                         mjc_PlaneCylinder, mjc_PlaneBox, mjraw_SphereSphere,
                         mjc_SphereSphere, mjraw_SphereCapsule, mjc_SphereCapsule,
                         mjc_SphereCylinder, mjraw_CapsuleCapsule, mjc_CapsuleCapsule
                         (src/collide_primitive.rs)
  engine_collision_box.c (Copyright 2016 Svetoslav Kolev; Apache-2.0)
                         mju_clampVec, mjraw_SphereBox, mjc_SphereBox,
                         mjraw_CapsuleBox (without its dead block), mjc_CapsuleBox,
